"last used (id {sync_id}, last synced {when}, {hosts} hosts, {quickies} "
"Quickies).\n"
"\n"
"This can happen on purpose (a new shared folder, a teammate's archive) or by "
"mistake (the wrong folder was chosen). Continuing merges this machine's "
"local hosts/settings into it — nothing is deleted on either side, but from "
"then on this machine treats that archive as the one it syncs with."
